{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_74251AC7","title":"Ava Needs Network Interface","entry":"Dlg_74251AC7::entry","exit":"Dlg_74251AC7::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_8EE0640E","articyId":"72057611218103203","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"A cursory scan of the chip suggests the data is mostly intact. And old. It has not been purged.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A cursory scan of the chip suggests the data is mostly intact. And old. It has not been purged.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-225.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38733","byteOffset":28986664,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_98CA1088","articyId":"72057611218103217","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That might be more difficult than I hoped. I know the data is there, but reading it is tricky. The chip is only compatible with a special Old Network interface.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That might be more difficult than I hoped. I know the data is there, but reading it is tricky. The chip is only compatible with a special Old Network interface.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37424","byteOffset":28497136,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_ECEBDF97","articyId":"72057611218103247","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Truthfully? I'm not sure if there are any left. Especially not in the LUZ. Maybe out in some half-deserted settlement on the outskirts. But here in the heart of the city...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Truthfully? I'm not sure if there are any left. Especially not in the LUZ. Maybe out in some half-deserted settlement on the outskirts. But here in the heart of the city...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38272","byteOffset":28814472,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_E757AFD8","articyId":"72057611218103261","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So far we have done well asking for help when we need it. We should reach out to someone who knows not just technology... but the streets.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So far we have done well asking for help when we need it. We should reach out to someone who knows not just technology... but the streets.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26290","byteOffset":17826464,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_C8912602","articyId":"72057821671269474","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Data purges happen after corporate scandals. The Coma Roamers were wiped from all data repositories that LifeCorp could find.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Data purges happen after corporate scandals. The Coma Roamers were wiped from all data repositories that LifeCorp could find.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":375.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44916","byteOffset":31326264,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_0CAD5D13","articyId":"72057821671269489","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"This